  "topic_key": "harmony/native-loader-launch",
  "revision": 2,
  "note": {
    "title": "apriltag-python 启动脚本未导出原生库目录致子进程加载失败",
    "type": "bugfix",
    "scope": "global",
    "phase": "session",
    "what": "验证启动脚本收了原生库目录参数却不导出 LD_LIBRARY_PATH，子进程环境为空，依赖 libapriltag.so 的导入仍报 Error loading shared library，3 项启动测试全败。",
    "why": "musl 只按动态链接器搜索路径解析 DT_NEEDED，且 LD_LIBRARY_PATH 仅在进程启动时读一次；父 shell 不导出则 python 内赋值、RTLD_GLOBAL 预加载都无效。",
    "where": "来源档案 am-347d912831feb751855892df（migbot-experience-raw），固定提交 343c60fd2309dbf1edf6d3169b80838c54e1f1cd；apriltag-python 3.4.5。",
    "learned": "在 exec 前加 export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"$native_dir${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\"：前置目录、不留空分量；换库时按该库自身 site-packages/<pkg> 重定位 native_dir 再传参，用原命令复跑。"
  },
